:: RobinTemple Prayer Event
<!-- ./src/twee/RobinTemple/PrayerEvents.twee -->
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_done to true>>
<<switch $RobinTemple.prayer_event>>
  <<case 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>The visitor has come from Wolf Street. The soup kitchen needs clean bowls before evening. Robin offers to carry a box from the shelves.
      <<option 'CN'>>那名访客从狼街来。施粥所在开门前缺一批干净的碗。罗宾提出从架上搬一箱过去。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '帮忙送碗 (0:30)' 'RobinTemple Prayer Bowls'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '记下施粥所需要什么' 'RobinTemple Prayer Note'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 2>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>The initiate has written the wrong number beside the linen and fears Jordan will think a whole bundle is missing.
      <<option 'CN'>>见习者说自己在布巾清单上写错了数，担心约旦以为少了一整捆。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '和罗宾一起核对清单 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Prayer List'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '请罗宾先安慰见习者' 'RobinTemple Prayer Comfort'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 3>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>The visitor has nowhere quiet to sit tonight. Robin looks toward the quarters, then offers a cup of water first.
      <<option 'CN'>>访客说今晚找不到安静的地方坐一会儿。罗宾望向宿舍方向，先端来一杯水。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '帮罗宾去问约旦 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Prayer Shelter'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '留下来陪访客等候' 'RobinTemple Prayer Wait'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 4>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>Robin says <<he>> heard someone arguing behind the side-room door. Neither of you knows what happened. "We can ask Jordan," <<he>> says, "rather than guessing."
      <<option 'CN'>>罗宾说听见侧室里有人争执。你们都不知道发生了什么。“可以去问约旦，”<<he>>说，“别只在这里猜。”
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '请约旦说明情况' 'RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink '先和罗宾离开' 'RobinTemple Prayer Leave'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</switch>>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Bowls
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>You and Robin wrap the bowls in linen and carry them to the kitchen on Wolf Street. The cook counts them before setting a pot on the stove.
  <<option 'CN'>>你和罗宾用布巾包好碗，送到狼街的厨房。厨师数过碗，才把锅架上炉灶。
<</language>>
<<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
<<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '回到神殿' 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Note
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>The visitor shows you the kitchen’s address and hours. Robin copies them into <<his>> schoolbook so neither of you has to rely on memory.
  <<option 'CN'>>访客告诉你厨房的位置和开放时间。罗宾把它们抄进课本，免得你们全靠记忆。
<</language>>
<<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>><span class='gold'>You learned where to find the soup kitchen.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>><span class='gold'>你得知了施粥所的位置。</span>
<</language>><br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer List
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>You count each bundle with Robin. The missing linen is on a shelf in the next room. The initiate corrects the entry while you hold the pages together.
  <<option 'CN'>>你和罗宾逐捆清点。漏记的布巾就放在隔壁的架子上。你扶住纸页，让见习者把数字改好。
<</language>>
<<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
<<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 2)>>
<<grace 1>><br><br><<ggrace>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Comfort
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>Robin sits with the initiate until the mistake can be explained. "We should check the shelves," Robin says. The two of you find the bundle and correct the list together.
  <<option 'CN'>>罗宾陪见习者坐了一会儿，等对方说清错在哪里。“先看看架子吧，”罗宾说。你们找到那捆布巾，一起改好清单。
<</language>>
<<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
<<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<glove>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Shelter
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>Jordan listens to the visitor and offers a place to rest until morning. Robin fetches water and a clean blanket, then asks whether the visitor needs anything else.
  <<option 'CN'>>约旦听完访客的情况，同意让对方留到天亮。罗宾端来水和干净的毯子，又问还有没有别的需要。
<</language>>
<<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
<<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Wait
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>You stay beside the visitor while Robin speaks to Jordan. When <<he>> returns, <<he>> has a blanket and permission for the visitor to rest in the quarters.
  <<option 'CN'>>罗宾去找约旦时，你留在访客身边。<<He>>带着毯子回来，也带来了让访客在宿舍休息的许可。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<stress -2>><br><br><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>Jordan says an initiate asked to stop a frightening task. "The initiate is safe," Jordan says. "I will speak with the attendants before that task is assigned again." Robin asks to be present for the conversation.
  <<option 'CN'>>约旦说，一名见习者请求停止一项令自己害怕的工作。“那名见习者现在安全了，”约旦说，“再次分配这项工作前，我会先和侍从谈谈。”罗宾提出也想在场。
<</language>>
<<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 2)>>
<<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<gdom>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Leave
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>You leave the side room behind. Robin walks with you to the hall, then says <<he>> will ask Jordan tomorrow what happened.
  <<option 'CN'>>你离开侧室门前。罗宾陪你走到大厅，说<<he>>明天会向约旦问清楚。
<</language>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
